  "_comment_rebatched": [
    "Re-batched to max_syms 8. crustify batches are ALL-OR-NOTHING: nothing a batch produces is",
    "promoted until its agent completes, so the first run lost 4h46m of three agents' work when the",
    "API dropped at 123 turns with 50-unit batches. Smaller batches bound the loss to one batch."
  ],
  "_comment_remainder": [
    "Remainder schedule: only units with no filled `/// Replaces:` anchor.",
    "The first level-0 run lost 9 of 18 batches to `API Error: ENOTFOUND` after ~180 turns each;",
    "the 9 that finished are on the branch and are excluded here."
  ]
